{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2023-02-16 06:30:00', 'title': 'SOUTHERN COMPANY REPORTS FOURTH-QUARTER AND FULL-YEAR 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': 'ATLANTA , FEB. 16, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHERN COMPANY TODAY REPORTED A FOURTH-QUARTER LOSS OF $87 MILLION, OR 8 CENTS PER SHARE, IN 2022 COMPARED WITH A LOSS OF $215 MILLION, OR 20 CENTS PER SHARE, IN THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2021. SOUTHERN COMPANY ALSO REPORTED FULL-YEAR 2022 EARNINGS OF $3.5 BILLION, OR $3.28 PER SHARE, COMPARED WITH $2.4 BILLION, OR $2.26 PER SHARE, IN 2021.'}